  personality: ???
  note: Do NOT let any people through matching these characteristics. Goes off on
    long ideological ramblings. Preaches themes of idealism, eternity, and freedom.
    Vaguely prescribes to marxists idealisms.
  genuineGreeting: ~Greets with long unsettling intonations not quite unlike the
    sound of a nail across a chalkboard put through a static filer~
  mimicGreeting: ~Greets with long unsettling intonations not quite unlike the sound
    of a nail across a chalkboard put through a static filer~
  genuineClosing: "We\u2019ll be in touch. I won\u2019t forget your kindness."
  mimicClosing: "We\u2019ll be in touch. I won\u2019t forget your kindness."
  genuineRejected: I see. You will regret this.
  mimicRejected: I see. You will regret this.
  genuineNameResponse: My name? My name is irrelevant. I am a purpose. An idealism
    in form.
  genuineBirthdayResponse: I am eternal.
  genuineReasonResponse: "Can you hear them as well? The voices on your radio? The
    ones that carry another\u2019s name? They only wish to be free. They mean you
    no harm. Let me through. Let me through and I can free them."
  genuineTimeResponse: ...
